# What a loongarch64 cell adds after the era's fragment (spec 06.2). Newer kernels have a 32 bit side as well, and tinyconfig picks it. The image from 6.1 on is vmlinuz.efi, which only builds with the EFI stub and its compressed wrapper.
CONFIG_64BIT=y
CONFIG_EFI=y
CONFIG_EFI_STUB=y
CONFIG_EFI_ZBOOT=y
